# ============================================================
# Websearch — provider listing and web search.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4096

### List websearch providers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/websearch/provider

### Search the web
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/websearch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "how to use MCP with OpenCode"
}